{"id":"d42ba324c0358975","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness.md","title":"小电路伪随机分布","display":"df-circuit-pseudorandomness — 小电路伪随机分布","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","aliases":["28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness"],"display":"df-circuit-pseudorandomness — 小电路伪随机分布","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.2","source_printed_pages":"404","source_pdf_pages":"430","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-pseudorandomness — 小电路伪随机分布"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 20.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"404"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"430"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_m\">\\(U_m\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^m\">\\(\\Sigma^m\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span> 为有限概率空间上的概率。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 的接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a>：测试电路为有界扇入、单比特输出电路，预算计入输入节点。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{m,1}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{m,1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]\">\\(R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 是概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1\">\\(\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(U_\\ell)\">\\(G(U_\\ell)\\)</span> 表示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m\">\\(G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m\\)</span> 对均匀种子的推前分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}_m\\coloneqq\\left\\{R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]\\;\\middle|\\;\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dist}_m\\coloneqq\\left\\{R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]\\;\\middle|\\;\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1-2^{-m}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1-2^{-m}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fool}_m(R;s,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)&lt;\\epsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fool}_m(R;s,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)&lt;\\epsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G(U_\\ell)(y)\\coloneqq2^{-\\ell}\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:G(z)=y\\}\\right|\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G(U_\\ell)(y)\\coloneqq2^{-\\ell}\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:G(z)=y\\}\\right|\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 20.2 的有限分布版本。这里沿用本目录的总节点预算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CircuitCost}=m+\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{CircuitCost}=m+\\operatorname{size}\\)</span>，不要把它与不计输入门的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 直接互换。严格不等号保留原书的约定。\n所有概率均为有限和；推前分布的纤维分割 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^\\ell\">\\(\\Sigma^\\ell\\)</span>，所以非负且总质量为一。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;m\">\\(s&lt;m\\)</span> 导致测试类为空，谓词仍良定义，但不能据此作有实质内容的安全性推断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-hardness","status":"resolved","id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-hardness","status":"resolved","id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\ell\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$。$U_m$ 为 $\\Sigma^m$ 上均匀分布；$\\Pr$ 为有限概率空间上的概率。\n$\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)$ 与 $\\operatorname{out}_C$ 的接口见 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]]：测试电路为有界扇入、单比特输出电路，预算计入输入节点。\n$C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{m,1}$；$R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]$ 是概率质量函数，$\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1$。$G(U_\\ell)$ 表示函数 $G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m$ 对均匀种子的推前分布。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"U_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{m,1}","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1","display":false},{"tex":"G(U_\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}_m\\coloneqq\\left\\{R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]\\;\\middle|\\;\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)\\coloneqq\\left|\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1-2^{-m}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}\\operatorname{out}_C(y)_1\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fool}_m(R;s,\\epsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(C,R)<\\epsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"G(U_\\ell)(y)\\coloneqq2^{-\\ell}\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:G(z)=y\\}\\right|\\qquad(y\\in\\Sigma^m).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CircuitCost}=m+\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"s<m","display":false}],"bytes":2277,"backlinks":[{"id":"fc596ec4c1021296","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$；$S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$G_\\ell$ 表示 $G$ 对 $\\Sigma^\\ell$ 的限制。\n$\\mathrm{TM}$、机器输出 $M(z)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_M(z)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{Fool}_m$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"},{"id":"6058569a5f2311c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$；$R\\in\\operatorname{Dist}_m$。\n$\\operatorname{Adv}$ 与测试电路类见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。$R_{<i}$、$R_i$ 为同一随机样本 $r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_m)\\leftarrow R$ 的前缀及第 $i$ 位投影；$r_{<1}$ 为空串。"},{"id":"0079cad93c58c949","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ell,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$d,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\ell>n>d$，$0<\\epsilon\\le1/2$。\n$\\mathcal I=(I_1,\\ldots,I_m)\\in\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,m}$，$f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma$。设计和生成器见 [[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]；测试类和欺骗谓词见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"},{"id":"31f962b1eba87e25","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$a,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$0<\\epsilon<1/6$。\n$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^a$，$\\chi_L:\\Sigma^a\\to\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L$；$A:\\Sigma^a\\times\\Sigma^m\\to\\Sigma$；$G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m$。\n对每个 $x\\in\\Sigma^a$，存在 $C_x\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)$，且 $\\operatorname{out}_{C_x}(r)_1=A(x,r)$ 对所有 $r\\in\\Sigma^m$ 成立。测试类与 $\\operatorname{Fool}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。"}],"outgoing":["4265af5de6457d74"]}